# 03-OFF / offers

**Goes here.** The proposition before purchase. Offer mechanics, guarantees and risk
reversal, bundles, discount depth against margin, offers without discounting,
subscription structure, upsells, price anchoring, referral programs with tracked
economics.

## Not here

- A gift in the box after purchase -> 17-CXP
- A one-off giveaway engineered for UGC, not repeatable -> 19-WLD
- The price of the product itself -> 01-PRD
- Persuasion psychology spanning ads, pages and email -> 99-multi or 11-ADC
- A founder interview spanning 4 or more modules -> 99-multi

**The OFF and WLD line is repeatability.** A referral program you run monthly with a
payback period is OFF. A referral stunt built on 1 moment is WLD. An "unconventional
offer" you could run every month is still OFF.

**Lesson from misfiles.** Founder interviews and a persuasion classic were filed here
because they mention offers. A source whose main subject is the brand's whole story
belongs in 99-multi even if the offer is the most memorable part.

