## Topics

offer mechanics, guarantees and risk reversal, bundles and AOV, discount depth and
margin, offers without discounting, subscription structure, upsell take rates, price
anchoring and decoys, offer congruence, referral mechanics.

## Look for

The mechanics of each offer type. What it does to conversion rate and to average order
value, SEPARATELY. What it does to margin. Which objection each kills. Guarantee cost
as a percentage of orders. Take rates on upsells and bundles. Subscription churn and
retention by structure.

## Skip

**Offer advice with no margin math.** An offer that raises conversion and kills profit
is not a good offer, and a source ignoring this is not worth ingesting. This is the
single most important skip rule in the folder.

## Scope mix

Mostly growth. The baseline is congruence: ad, page, checkout and email state the
same offer, and no expired promotion is visible anywhere.

## Done when

You have at least 12 distinct offer mechanics, each with its cost, its take rate range
and the objection it answers.

